*name C10NAT
*call yesmemory
*perso:602300
*no list
*forex
c---- C10 native: COMPLEX + - * / (all four operations).
      PROGRAM C10NAT
      COMPLEX Z1,Z2,ZS,ZD,ZP,ZQ
      Z1=(3.0,4.0)
      Z2=(1.0,2.0)
      ZS=Z1+Z2
      ZD=Z1-Z2
      ZP=Z1*Z2
      ZQ=Z1/Z2
      PRINT 10,ZS,ZD,ZP,ZQ
   10 FORMAT(1X,8F10.4)
      STOP
      END
*execute
*end file
``````
